# GitHub usernames of the team, one per line: their keys come from
# https://github.com/<user>.keys. Copy to /etc/boxe/users.
# After the username, the member's email at the identity provider: only then
# can they use the agent of their VMs on the web (https://<vm>--agent...) and
# see them in the panel. "admin" after the email: the panel shows them every
# VM and the host page, and lets them open the console of, restart or delete
# any VM.
octocat octocat@example.com admin
hubot hubot@example.com
